  partName: Rear Blade Shroud 3
  description: The Rear Blade Shroud 3 is a thin, flat component located at the middle-center-rear
    of the engine, crafted from Blades2 material. Similar to the Rear Blade Shroud
    1 and 2, it provides a protective casing for the Rear Blade 3, ensuring a smooth
    airflow and minimizing obstruction. Its identical design to the previous shrouds
    highlights the engine's use of standardized components, simplifying manufacturing
    and maintenance processes.
